msgstr "A zone is defined by a polygon that is never displayed as such."

msgid ""
"Un massif est réputé appartenir à une zone quand son polygone INTERSECTE "
"celui de la zone."
msgstr ""
"A mountain range is deemed to belong to a zone when its polygon INTERSECTS "
"the zone's polygon."

msgid ""
"La zone n'a donc pas besoin d'être très précise : un vague rectangle suffit "
"la plupart du temps du moment qu'il recouvre au moins un bout de chaque "
"massif."
msgstr ""
"The zone therefore does not need to be very precise: a rough rectangle is "
"enough most of the time as long as it covers at least a bit of each mountain "
"range."

msgid ""
"Par contre, si elle déborde sur un massif qui n'a rien à voir, celui-ci sera "
"affiché."
msgstr ""
"On the other hand, if it spills over onto an unrelated mountain range, that "
"mountain range will be displayed."

